OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMist and fog patches in the
OL,6,Fsouth clearing this morning, then
OL,7,Fstaying dry with warm sunny spells.
OL,8,FCloudier and windy in the north with
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle at
OL,10,Ftimes. Gradually turning cooler in
OL,11,FScotland.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWinds easing in the north and
OL,14,Frain moving into central parts of the
OL,15,FUK. Clear spells in the south with
OL,16,Fmist and fog patches forming. Turning
OL,17,Fchilly where skies clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
